---
// Everything is a Pane: the Strip's columns, side by side, scrolling
// sideways inside the page as they do in the window. The last column is
// the one an Agent writes next.
import DeskSection from "./DeskSection.astro"
import Icon from "./Icon.astro"
---

<DeskSection
  id="panes"
  num="04"
  label="Panes"
  quiet="Side by side."
  loud="Everything is a Pane."
>
  <p slot="say">
    Threads, the terminal, a browser, files and the Diff stand in columns you
    scroll through, as in niri. Each is an App on one open SDK, with no special
    rights. An Agent can write the next one.
  </p>
  <div class="glass">
    <div
      class="strip"
      tabindex="0"
      role="region"
      aria-label="A strip of Panes: scroll sideways"
      data-strip
    >
      <article class="pane">
        <div class="ph">
          <span data-mark="done" data-size="16" data-calls="false"></span>
          <span class="chip">
            <span class="sign">B</span>banda
          </span>
          <span class="pt">Fix blank window on reload</span>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="bubble">
            The window is blank after a reload. Find out why.
          </div>
          <div class="fold">
            <Icon name="layers" size={14} />
            Read 6 files, ran 3 commands, edited 2 files{" "}
            <span class="add">+38</span>
            <span class="rem">−9</span>
          </div>
          <p class="prose">
            The page rendered before the engine answered. It now waits for the
            first state, then draws. Reload works; the test is in{" "}
            <code>window.test.ts</code>.
          </p>
          <p class="cap">
            <b>Thread.</b> You and an Agent, in markdown. Work folds into one
            line.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="pane">
        <div class="ph">
          <span data-mark="working" data-doing="reply" data-size="16"></span>
          <span class="chip">
            <span class="sign t">W</span>Work
          </span>
          <span class="pt">Reconcile February bank statements</span>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="bubble">
            Match the February statement against invoices/ and list what's
            missing.
          </div>
          <div class="fold">
            <Icon name="layers" size={14} />
            Read 14 files, searched for 2 patterns
          </div>
          <p class="prose dim">
            Three payments have no invoice yet. I'm writing them to{" "}
            <code>missing.md</code>…
          </p>
          <p class="cap">
            <b>Codex, too.</b> Claude Code or Codex: the Harnesses you already
            have.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="pane">
        <div class="ph">
          <Icon name="term" size={15} class="dim" />
          <span class="pt">zsh</span>
          <span class="pm">devbox · ~/code/banda</span>
        </div>
        <div class="body mono">
          <div>
            <span class="c">$ git status --short</span>
          </div>
          <div>&nbsp;M client/web/src/sidebar/settings.ts</div>
          <div>&nbsp;M client/web/src/sidebar/Sidebar.tsx</div>
          <div>?? sidebar.toml</div>
          <div>&nbsp;</div>
          <div>
            <span class="c">$ pnpm vitest sidebar</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="g">&nbsp;✓</span> sidebar/settings.test.ts
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="g">&nbsp;✓</span> sidebar/toml.test.ts
          </div>
          <div>&nbsp;</div>
          <div>
            <span class="c">$ </span>
            <span class="cur"></span>
          </div>
          <p class="cap">
            <b>Terminal.</b> A real shell, on whichever machine the Project
            lives.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="pane">
        <div class="ph">
          <Icon name="globe" size={15} class="dim" />
          <span class="url">
            <b>localhost:5173</b>/settings/sidebar
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="page">
          <h4>Sidebar</h4>
          <div class="sub">Saved in sidebar.toml</div>
          <div class="prow">
            <span>Oldest first</span>
            <span class="tog on"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="prow">
            <span>Show Later</span>
            <span class="tog"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="prow">
            <span>Group by Project</span>
            <span class="tog on"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="body foot">
          <p class="cap">
            <b>Browser.</b> Chromium in a Pane, beside the Thread that changes
            the page.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="pane">
        <div class="ph">
          <Icon name="folder" size={15} class="dim" />
          <span class="pt">Files</span>
          <span class="pm">banda</span>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="tree">
            <div>
              <Icon name="chev" size={14} style="transform:rotate(90deg)" />
              <Icon name="folder" size={15} />
              docs
            </div>
            <div class="in">
              <Icon name="file" size={15} />
              what-we-build.md
            </div>
            <div class="in">
              <Icon name="file" size={15} />
              plan.md
            </div>
            <div class="in f sel">
              <Icon name="file" size={15} />
              report.html
            </div>
            <div>
              <Icon name="chev" size={14} />
              <Icon name="folder" size={15} />
              client
            </div>
            <div class="f">
              <Icon name="file" size={15} />
              sidebar.toml
            </div>
            <div class="f">
              <Icon name="file" size={15} />
              settings.json
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="cap">
            <b>Files.</b> md, html and json that you and an Agent both read.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="pane">
        <div class="ph">
          <Icon name="branch" size={15} class="dim" />
          <span class="pt">Diff</span>
          <span class="pm">feat/sidebar-toml</span>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="diff">
            <div class="h">sidebar.toml</div>
            <div class="a">+ [sidebar]</div>
            <div class="a">+ oldest_first = true</div>
            <div class="a">+ show_later = false</div>
            <div class="h">settings.ts</div>
            <div class="r">- const row = json.row ?? {"{}"}</div>
            <div class="a">+ const row = toml.sidebar ?? json.row</div>
          </div>
          <p class="cap">
            <b>Diff.</b> What the Agents changed, before it is yours.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="pane yours">
        <div class="ph">
          <Icon name="app" size={15} class="dim" />
          <span class="pt">Your App</span>
        </div>
        <div class="body center">
          <div class="ask">
            <div class="meta">You, in a Thread:</div>
            <div class="bubble wide">
              Make me a Pane that lists every open PR across my Projects.
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="cap">
            <b>Next column: yours.</b> An Agent writes a new App in a Thread,
            and it opens here like any other Pane.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="nav">
      <div class="map" aria-hidden="true" data-map>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <b data-view></b>
      </div>
      <span class="lbl">Scroll the columns</span>
      <div class="arr">
        <button class="ib" type="button" aria-label="Previous Pane" data-prev>
          <Icon name="left" size={16} />
        </button>
        <button class="ib" type="button" aria-label="Next Pane" data-next>
          <Icon name="right" size={16} />
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</DeskSection>

<script>
  import { reduced, stillOffscreen } from "../lib/mark"

  const section = document.getElementById("panes")!
  stillOffscreen(section)
  const strip = section.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-strip]")!
  const view = section.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-view]")!
  // The overview under the strip: which columns are in sight.
  function overview() {
    const cells = 7 * 25 - 3
    view.style.width = `${Math.max(22, (cells * strip.clientWidth) / strip.scrollWidth)}px`
    view.style.transform = `translateX(${(cells * strip.scrollLeft) / strip.scrollWidth}px)`
  }
  strip.addEventListener("scroll", overview, { passive: true })
  addEventListener("resize", overview)
  overview()
  const step = (direction: number) =>
    strip.scrollBy({
      left:
        direction *
        (strip.querySelector<HTMLElement>(".pane")!.offsetWidth + 8),
      behavior: reduced ? "auto" : "smooth",
    })
  section
    .querySelector("[data-prev]")!
    .addEventListener("click", () => step(-1))
  section.querySelector("[data-next]")!.addEventListener("click", () => step(1))
</script>

<style>
  .strip {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--gap-outer);
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    border-radius: var(--tile-radius);
    overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
  }
  .strip::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }
  .pane {
    flex: 0 0 400px;
    height: 390px;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    border-radius: var(--tile-radius);
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--background) 95%, transparent);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 20px;
  }
  .pane.yours {
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--background) 55%, transparent);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--input);
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .pane {
      flex-basis: calc(100vw - 64px);
      height: 430px;
    }
  }
  .ph {
    height: 40px;
    flex: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 0 12px 0 14px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .pt {
    font-weight: 500;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-width: 0;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, #000 calc(100% - 24px), transparent);
  }
  .pm {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .dim {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    flex: none;
  }
  .chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .sign {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font: 600 9px/1 var(--font-family-sans);
    color: var(--background);
    background: var(--sign-violet);
  }
  .sign.t {
    background: var(--sign-teal);
  }
  .body {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    padding: 4px 16px 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .body.foot {
    flex: none;
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  .body.center {
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .body.mono {
    font: 12.5px/20px var(--font-family-mono);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    gap: 0;
  }
  .c {
    color: var(--foreground);
  }
  .g {
    color: var(--ansi-2);
  }
  .cur {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 7px;
    height: 14px;
    background: var(--foreground);
    vertical-align: -2px;
  }
  .bubble {
    align-self: flex-end;
    max-width: 92%;
    background: var(--raised);
    border-radius: var(--card-radius);
    padding: 8px 12px;
    line-height: 22px;
  }
  .bubble.wide {
    align-self: stretch;
    max-width: none;
  }
  .fold {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .add {
    color: var(--added);
  }
  .rem {
    color: var(--destructive);
  }
  .prose {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 22px;
  }
  .prose.dim {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .prose code {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    background: var(--raised);
    border-radius: var(--small-radius);
    padding: 1px 5px;
  }
  .cap {
    margin: auto 0 0;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font: 13px/19px var(--font-family-sans);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .foot .cap {
    border: 0;
  }
  .cap b {
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-weight: 560;
  }
  .url {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    height: 26px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 10px;
    border-radius: var(--control-radius);
    background: var(--block);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 12px;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border);
  }
  .url b {
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .page {
    flex: 1;
    margin: 0 8px;
    border-radius: var(--card-radius) var(--card-radius) 0 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--gallery-ink);
    padding: 16px 18px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 18px;
  }
  .page h4 {
    margin: 0 0 2px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .page .sub {
    color: var(--gallery-muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .prow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 9px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--gallery-line);
  }
  .tog {
    width: 28px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--gallery-ink) 18%, var(--paper));
    position: relative;
  }
  .tog::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 2px;
    left: 2px;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--paper);
  }
  .tog.on {
    background: var(--gallery-ink);
  }
  .tog.on::after {
    transform: translateX(12px);
  }
  .tree {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 28px;
  }
  .tree div {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .tree .f {
    color: var(--foreground);
  }
  .tree .in {
    padding-left: 22px;
  }
  .tree .sel {
    background: var(--raised);
    border-radius: var(--control-radius);
    margin: 0 -8px;
    padding: 0 8px 0 30px;
  }
  .diff {
    font: 12.5px/20px var(--font-family-mono);
    border-radius: var(--card-radius);
    background: var(--block);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .diff div {
    padding: 0 10px;
    white-space: pre;
  }
  .diff .a {
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--added) 13%, transparent);
    color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--added) 80%, var(--foreground));
  }
  .diff .r {
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--destructive) 13%, transparent);
    color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--destructive) 75%, var(--foreground));
  }
  .diff .h {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .ask {
    border-radius: var(--card-radius);
    background: var(--block);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border);
    padding: 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .meta {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 10px 8px 2px;
  }
  .map {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3px;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    height: 22px;
    padding: 0 4px;
  }
  .map span {
    width: 22px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--raised);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border);
  }
  .map b {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1px;
    left: 2px;
    height: 20px;
    width: 22px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--foreground);
  }
  .lbl {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .arr {
    margin-left: auto;
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .ib {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: var(--control-radius);
    border: 0;
    background: var(--raised);
    color: var(--foreground);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .ib:hover {
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 14%, transparent);
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .lbl {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
